    "Workout — default = active capture fixture. \"Workout\" with Finish; current station (outlined 01, \"Goblet squat\" display, \"Exercise 1 of 5\", \"Set 2 of 3\" + \"1 set recorded\", stacked left-aligned at AX2 per R24); target and last set; Repetitions and Weight entry rows; cue disclosure; \"Goblet squat sets\"; \"Your stations\"; dock Confirm set.",
    "Coach — \"Coach\" + plain \"Sample conversation\" label (R21); context; your turn; coach turn; proposal (35 → 20 min, 7 planned sets, three stations, omitted work, Review shorter plan); prompts; composer dock. r1 and r2 measured: proposal button bottom 653 vs dock top 662 at 402 — tightest page; at 440 (Pro Max) the proposal and the first prompt fit with room. At AX2 the composer grows to show its whole example (R23), and the proposal action is reached by scrolling.",
